            </note>
            <note corresp="#d386-f2" n="3" xml:id="d386-f2-content">
                <p>See footnote 95, <ref target="#pg468">p. 468</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d386-f3" n="4" xml:id="d386-f3-content">
                <p>The Chinese Ambassador called on General Hilldring on July 24 to state the
                    Chinese position and added the desire for the conference to meet in China during
                    its session (740.0011 PW (Peace)/7–2447).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
